00:00:09.984 --> 00:00:14.484
This tool will let you look at the data and the different datasets in a number of different ways.

00:00:14.484 --> 00:00:17.484
I'll show you how to access it and how to use its features.

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:19.968
First, you're going to want to go to the Data tab over

00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:24.648
here. The first thing we're going to want to do is import a dataset. So you can

00:00:24.648 --> 00:00:29.568
