00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:35.700
Across the top, you'll see that there's a place to put a title in for your chart. You can choose between

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:39.845
what type of chart you want to make. You can make a bar chart, a histogram,

00:01:39.845 --> 00:01:46.845
