00:01:46.845 --> 00:01:49.829
If we're going to make a bar chart, we

00:01:49.829 --> 00:01:54.709
first need to decide which value it is that we want to graph.

00:01:54.709 --> 00:01:59.814
Now, we can look at these values in this dropdown and choose that way, or we can

00:01:59.814 --> 00:02:03.854
